  "description_short": "Farm-to-table dining in a tranquil garden setting between Nature's Valley and The Crags.",
  "description_long": "Tucked away on the scenic R102 between Nature's Valley and The Crags, Lily Pond Restaurant offers a peaceful escape with honest farm-to-table fare. The menu changes with the seasons, showcasing fresh local produce in a relaxed garden setting that feels worlds away from the main tourist routes.\n\nThe restaurant's charm lies in its simplicity and connection to the surrounding landscape. Whether you're stopping for a leisurely lunch after a coastal hike or seeking a quiet dinner spot, the outdoor seating under established trees creates an unhurried atmosphere. Popular with locals and visitors who appreciate straightforward, well-prepared meals without pretension.\n\nIts location makes it an ideal midway stop for those exploring the Tsitsikamma region, offering both sustenance and a moment to slow down in one of the Garden Route's more untouched corners.",
